SUMMARY:World's Largest Swim Lesson
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 2026 World’s Largest Swim Lesson! \nSwimAmerica-Davis is excited to be part of this worldwide event focused on drowning prevention and water safety. \nEveryone is invited to participate in one free 30-minute lesson on Thursday\, June 25. Choose from either 2:15–2:45 p.m. or 2:45–3:15 p.m. \nParents and children will be in the water together while our experienced coaches lead them through fun and important water safety skills\, including safe entry\, back floats\, and building water confidence. \nIt’s free\, fun\, and a great way to be part of something happening all around the world. Sign up online and join us at the pool! \nQuestions? Give us a call at 530-759-1214. We’re happy to help! \nWe can’t wait to swim with you!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/worlds-largest-swim-lesson/
LOCATION:SwimAmerica-Davis\, 2121 2nd Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95618\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Community,Fitness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2026-1-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="SwimAmerica-Davis":MAILTO:frontdesk@swimamericadavis.com
END:VEVENT
